WEBVTT

01:38.340 --> 01:41.030
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.990
[Episode 4]

01:48.560 --> 01:49.430
Manniang?

02:01.230 --> 02:02.120
You recognized me?

02:02.640 --> 02:03.400
My name is Chi Xue.

02:03.430 --> 02:04.120
We've met before.

02:06.190 --> 02:07.520
What are you doing in Guangping City?

02:08.360 --> 02:09.870
Did your brother marry a demon again?

02:11.710 --> 02:12.190
Let's go.

02:20.560 --> 02:21.690
[Tianji]

02:23.120 --> 02:23.800
That's all.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.030
Come, come.

02:26.150 --> 02:27.030
Have some water.

02:28.110 --> 02:29.110
Would you like some tea?

02:30.240 --> 02:31.000
No need to trouble yourself.

02:31.000 --> 02:31.560
I'm not thirsty.

02:32.320 --> 02:32.950
That's good.

02:33.930 --> 02:34.810
We don't have tea anyway.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.470
So, you suspect...

02:47.910 --> 02:48.910
your father is still alive?

02:49.360 --> 02:49.750
Yes.

02:51.190 --> 02:52.150
Have you told your family?

02:53.430 --> 02:54.070
I have.

02:54.710 --> 02:56.000
But no one believed me.

02:57.720 --> 02:59.000
I came to you

02:59.030 --> 02:59.870
because I had no choice.

03:04.240 --> 03:05.560
You believe me, right?

03:07.750 --> 03:08.910
Was there anything unusual about the body?

03:09.590 --> 03:10.080
No.

03:10.590 --> 03:11.800
The officials examined the body.

03:12.630 --> 03:14.240
But it could be fake, you know.

03:14.680 --> 03:16.310
Maybe my father was captured by a demon.

03:16.950 --> 03:17.840
He might still be alive,

03:17.870 --> 03:18.400
right?

03:19.840 --> 03:20.450
Perhaps.

03:21.710 --> 03:23.050
Do you have any other clues?

03:23.750 --> 03:24.240
Yes.

03:29.700 --> 03:30.470
There are two mirrors.

03:31.010 --> 03:31.780
One was found

03:31.800 --> 03:32.990
in my father's room,

03:33.430 --> 03:34.740
and the other was at the fire scene.

03:41.710 --> 03:42.630
What's with these mirrors?

03:43.020 --> 03:43.900
What's unusual about them?

03:46.060 --> 03:47.570
When I first found them,

03:47.630 --> 03:48.840
they didn't show any reflections.

03:49.240 --> 03:50.990
But by the next day, they were back to normal.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.560
The reason I came to find you

03:57.700 --> 03:58.770
is that I hope you can accompany me

03:58.800 --> 03:59.870
back to Nanyang City

04:00.360 --> 04:01.120
to help me investigate

04:01.120 --> 04:02.310
the truth behind my father's disappearance.

04:05.560 --> 04:06.120
No.

04:07.430 --> 04:08.120
Why?

04:12.080 --> 04:13.360
I have other things to do.

04:13.560 --> 04:14.590
I can't leave for now.

04:15.000 --> 04:15.840
You should leave

04:15.870 --> 04:16.630
Guangping as soon as possible.

04:17.070 --> 04:17.630
I'm not leaving.

04:18.630 --> 04:19.600
No one believes me.

04:19.880 --> 04:20.800
Now, no one can help me

04:20.829 --> 04:21.680
except you.

04:24.480 --> 04:25.310
Do you have money?

04:25.740 --> 04:26.770
We demon hunters

04:26.800 --> 04:27.750
charge for our services.

04:28.310 --> 04:29.040
I have money.

04:30.800 --> 04:31.190
Here.

04:35.150 --> 04:35.680
This isn't enough.

04:37.430 --> 04:38.870
There are 60 to 70 taels of silver in here.

04:39.430 --> 04:39.800
Demons

04:40.070 --> 04:41.430
are mostly vicious and cunning,

04:41.750 --> 04:42.830
possessing demonic powers.

04:42.830 --> 04:43.750
They're very dangerous.

04:44.480 --> 04:46.190
I have to risk my life doing this job.

04:47.000 --> 04:48.210
Do you think this small amount of money

04:48.270 --> 04:49.210
is worth me risking my life for?

04:50.070 --> 04:51.409
But weren't you…

04:51.770 --> 04:52.400
That was because

04:52.430 --> 04:53.800
Lord Geng from the Guangping Government

04:53.820 --> 04:54.820
personally invited me

04:55.150 --> 04:56.240
to help capture

04:56.390 --> 04:58.270
the throat-slicing bandit.

04:58.800 --> 05:00.170
The reward was very generous.

05:00.480 --> 05:01.200
It was different from your case.

05:01.510 --> 05:03.360
Aren't you a demon hunter? You...

05:03.430 --> 05:04.700
Demon hunters are still humans.

05:04.920 --> 05:05.800
We also need to make a living,

05:06.160 --> 05:06.630
don't we?

05:10.680 --> 05:11.240
I'm sorry.

05:11.750 --> 05:12.840
I can't help you with this.

05:13.070 --> 05:14.160
You should look for someone else.

05:15.070 --> 05:15.920
Wait a moment.

05:17.870 --> 05:18.680
I'll give you the money.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.490
Name your price, and I'll try to gather it.

05:22.000 --> 05:22.920
Didn't I already tell you?

05:22.950 --> 05:24.920
I have something to do and can't leave for now.

05:25.560 --> 05:27.390
You clearly don't want to help me.

05:28.040 --> 05:28.600
Chi Xue!

05:28.950 --> 05:29.390
See them out.

05:29.600 --> 05:30.000
Coming.

05:32.800 --> 05:33.680
This way, please.

05:52.390 --> 05:53.430
Alright, stop looking.

05:57.000 --> 05:57.680
Where's the sound eel?

05:58.310 --> 05:59.190
How did it escape?

06:00.040 --> 06:00.920
How did I not notice?

06:02.560 --> 06:03.840
Didn't you know the sound eel escaped?

06:10.290 --> 06:11.180
Where are you going to find it?

06:12.390 --> 06:13.360
The bait has already been set.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.270
Is it hard to find it?

06:17.480 --> 06:18.830
Physician Jiu, you're in quite a mood.

06:20.750 --> 06:21.950
You just got home,

06:22.190 --> 06:23.120
and now you're heading out again.

06:23.600 --> 06:24.720
Don't tell me you're off to hunt demons again.

06:27.870 --> 06:28.360
My Lady,

06:29.040 --> 06:30.070
don't be discouraged.

06:30.750 --> 06:31.920
Guangping is so big.

06:32.150 --> 06:33.710
He's definitely not the only demon hunter here.

06:34.000 --> 06:34.920
Let's search slowly,

06:35.190 --> 06:36.680
and we'll surely find someone capable of saving your father.

06:39.490 --> 06:41.770
[For Rent]

06:50.630 --> 06:51.600
It's just a few words.

06:52.040 --> 06:52.900
It won't take up too much

06:52.930 --> 06:53.810
of your time.

06:57.190 --> 06:58.270
Where did that villain go?

06:58.900 --> 06:59.720
His behavior was suspicious,

06:59.750 --> 07:00.510
and he attacked the officials.

07:00.870 --> 07:02.120
I suspect he's involved in a case

07:02.390 --> 07:03.240
and want to capture him for questioning.

07:03.720 --> 07:04.190
He ran away.

07:04.640 --> 07:05.320
He ran away?

07:06.460 --> 07:07.840
Physician Jiu, why did I hear that

07:07.870 --> 07:08.870
it was you who dragged him away?

07:09.260 --> 07:09.820
It's been so long.

07:09.840 --> 07:10.810
Have you gotten anything out of him?

07:11.190 --> 07:12.270
What's his background?

07:12.460 --> 07:13.280
What's his connection

07:13.310 --> 07:14.040
to that throat-slitter?

07:15.070 --> 07:15.680
Chief Constable Chu,

07:16.190 --> 07:16.920
haven't you

07:16.950 --> 07:17.830
always thought

07:17.830 --> 07:18.560
I was a murderer?

07:18.830 --> 07:19.680
Then why did you ask me?

07:19.950 --> 07:20.750
Investigate it yourself.

07:24.000 --> 07:24.670
Jiu Xuanye,

07:25.560 --> 07:26.800
don't think that just because you saved my life,

07:26.830 --> 07:27.800
I'll let you off the hook.

07:29.030 --> 07:29.560
Chief Chu.

07:30.920 --> 07:31.310
Chief Chu,

07:31.720 --> 07:32.390
His Lordship is looking for you.

07:47.170 --> 07:47.630
Xuanye,

07:48.190 --> 07:48.750
you're angry.

07:51.040 --> 07:51.830
You are angry.

07:54.120 --> 07:55.520
We've already wasted too much time.

07:55.640 --> 07:56.400
We must find

07:56.430 --> 07:57.270
Duan Banxia as soon as possible.

07:57.750 --> 07:58.600
We can't let the sound eel

07:58.600 --> 07:59.470
get there first.

08:00.870 --> 08:02.240
We are catching the sound eel.

08:02.260 --> 08:03.260
Why should we look for Duan Banxia?

08:04.190 --> 08:04.720
Besides, didn't you

08:04.750 --> 08:05.600
just drive her away?

08:07.480 --> 08:08.270
I see.

08:08.950 --> 08:09.830
You regret it.

08:09.950 --> 08:10.830
You want to apologize to her.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.510
Who caught the Human-faced Owl?

08:15.390 --> 08:15.870
You.

08:16.510 --> 08:16.950
And who else?

08:17.600 --> 08:18.040
Me.

08:21.370 --> 08:22.690
And Manniang.

08:24.820 --> 08:25.380
Oh, right.

08:26.310 --> 08:28.120
The sound eel is a companion demon of the Human-faced Owl.

08:28.360 --> 08:29.240
Now that the Human-faced Owl is dead,

08:29.370 --> 08:30.810
he will naturally seek revenge for it.

08:31.560 --> 08:33.100
But he can't beat you,

08:33.360 --> 08:34.049
so he'll go after

08:34.080 --> 08:34.960
Duan Banxia instead.

08:35.840 --> 08:36.669
You finally get it.

08:39.390 --> 08:40.909
Then why did you drive her away?

08:42.360 --> 08:43.000
If she hadn't left,

08:43.120 --> 08:44.120
would the sound eel show itself?

08:46.960 --> 08:47.790
Indeed.

08:48.270 --> 08:49.440
There aren't many inns in the city.

08:49.720 --> 08:50.390
Let's split up and search.

08:53.320 --> 08:54.030
Let's split up and search.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.150
Be careful, Miss.

08:59.750 --> 09:00.650
This corridor

09:00.680 --> 09:01.770
connects the front and back courtyards.

09:01.870 --> 09:02.690
The yard is spacious,

09:02.870 --> 09:03.800
with a pleasant view,

09:03.870 --> 09:05.360
and there are several side rooms.

09:05.840 --> 09:07.330
If your family is large,

09:07.550 --> 09:08.830
there's plenty of space for everyone.

09:09.600 --> 09:10.530
Let me show you this room.

09:13.510 --> 09:14.210
Be careful.

09:16.320 --> 09:16.720
Come.

09:17.320 --> 09:17.970
Come in and have a look.

09:18.910 --> 09:19.670
How's this?

09:23.390 --> 09:24.370
This side room is big, isn't it?

09:24.550 --> 09:25.360
Sir,

09:25.790 --> 09:27.080
you call this good business?

09:27.720 --> 09:29.120
Let's be frank.

09:29.480 --> 09:31.150
This shop is indeed not bad,

09:31.940 --> 09:33.240
but there's dust everywhere.

09:33.260 --> 09:35.190
It doesn't seem like it's been regularly used.

09:39.030 --> 09:41.070
Is there something wrong with it?

09:41.740 --> 09:42.670
No, no, no.

09:42.740 --> 09:44.110
How could there be a problem?

09:44.360 --> 09:45.520
Didn't I tell you?

09:45.550 --> 09:46.790
This shop is about to close down.

09:46.980 --> 09:47.490
So

09:47.510 --> 09:48.740
we haven't stayed here for a while.

09:48.790 --> 09:49.490
That's why there's a bit of dust.

09:50.480 --> 09:50.950
Sir,

09:51.880 --> 09:53.330
are you familiar with the owner

09:53.360 --> 09:53.870
of the pharmacy next door?

09:54.120 --> 09:54.670
No.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.320
Not at all.

09:57.220 --> 09:57.930
Because we each mind

09:57.960 --> 09:59.320
our own business.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.360
We have never interacted.

10:00.720 --> 10:01.280
What's wrong, Miss?

10:01.750 --> 10:02.390
Did you hear

10:02.390 --> 10:03.150
some rumors?

10:03.690 --> 10:04.570
You mustn't believe them.

10:04.600 --> 10:05.480
They're all nonsense,

10:05.510 --> 10:06.600
completely unfounded.

10:06.630 --> 10:07.150
Sir,

10:07.630 --> 10:08.870
get paper and a brush.

10:09.320 --> 10:10.200
Let's write a contract.

10:10.260 --> 10:11.340
I'm renting this shop.

10:12.080 --> 10:13.020
Alright, alright, I'll go get them right away.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.290
[Rental Agreement]

10:26.000 --> 10:27.110
Well, ladies,

10:27.400 --> 10:28.360
please make yourselves at home.

10:28.500 --> 10:29.340
I'll take my leave now.

10:32.790 --> 10:33.600
My Lady,

10:34.440 --> 10:35.320
we're already short on money.

10:35.350 --> 10:36.790
Why did you rent a shop?

10:37.350 --> 10:39.040
Wouldn't it be better to just stay at an inn?

10:41.960 --> 10:43.120
What were you thinking?

10:46.200 --> 10:47.720
Do you think he refused to help us

10:47.910 --> 10:49.510
just because

10:49.710 --> 10:50.790
he wants money?

10:53.960 --> 10:55.000
Then why is it?

10:56.390 --> 10:58.120
If it were really about money,

10:58.470 --> 10:59.570
he could have just given us

10:59.600 --> 11:00.440
a specific number, right?

11:01.040 --> 11:02.210
Besides, my family isn't poor,

11:02.240 --> 11:03.200
and he knows that.

11:04.200 --> 11:05.690
From my interactions with him before,

11:05.930 --> 11:06.570
I don't think

11:06.600 --> 11:07.950
he's a person who's driven by money.

11:08.630 --> 11:10.320
You've only known him for a few days.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.480
What could you possibly see?

11:12.360 --> 11:13.240
Anyway, I feel like

11:13.270 --> 11:14.350
there's another reason.

11:17.000 --> 11:18.240
Could it be

11:18.480 --> 11:19.450
that he thinks this matter

11:19.480 --> 11:20.340
is too tricky,

11:20.480 --> 11:21.360
and he can't handle it,

11:21.720 --> 11:22.750
so he's not helping us?

11:24.360 --> 11:25.240
That's possible.

11:25.870 --> 11:27.080
So what should we do now?

11:27.720 --> 11:28.970
Let's write a letter to Yuanzhou

11:29.000 --> 11:30.000
and have them send us the money.

11:30.960 --> 11:32.240
Aren't you going to write to Young Master?

11:33.320 --> 11:34.360
If my brother finds out

11:34.390 --> 11:35.480
I'm here,

11:35.600 --> 11:36.570
he'll come

11:36.600 --> 11:37.480
and drag me back right away.

11:38.120 --> 11:40.030
Nanyang is not far from Yuanzhou.

11:40.480 --> 11:41.360
If you send a letter home,

11:41.390 --> 11:42.790
Young Master will find out sooner or later.

11:43.800 --> 11:45.370
Let's just delay it as long as we can.

11:47.960 --> 11:48.480
And then?

11:49.510 --> 11:51.210
Then we'll find out

11:51.870 --> 11:53.200
why he's not helping us.

11:58.710 --> 12:01.040
[Ganshan Clinic]

12:09.510 --> 12:10.170
Chi Xue,

12:10.750 --> 12:11.440
have you found her?

12:13.720 --> 12:14.400
No.

12:15.610 --> 12:16.520
I've searched all the inns

12:16.550 --> 12:17.480
on the east side of the city,

12:17.720 --> 12:19.080
but I couldn't find Manniang.

12:22.910 --> 12:23.600
Do you think

12:24.360 --> 12:25.670
she might have been eaten by the sound eel?

12:27.740 --> 12:28.670
Physician Jiu,

12:28.790 --> 12:29.320
Chi Xue.

12:31.390 --> 12:33.200
I brought some sweet cakes

12:33.320 --> 12:33.960
and candies for you.

12:34.360 --> 12:35.200
Blessing cakes and candy?

12:36.790 --> 12:37.270
Why?

12:38.240 --> 12:39.120
I just moved next door.

12:39.600 --> 12:40.390
next door.

12:40.870 --> 12:41.600
I just arrived in Guangping

12:41.620 --> 12:43.030
and had nowhere to stay.

12:43.360 --> 12:44.700
I found the inns too noisy,

12:45.200 --> 12:47.360
but fortunately, there was a shop next door

12:47.720 --> 12:48.570
available for rent at a good price,

12:48.600 --> 12:49.440
so I rented it.

12:49.750 --> 12:51.120
We'll be neighbors from now on.

12:51.630 --> 12:52.600
We should look out for each other.

12:53.120 --> 12:54.120
It's getting late.

12:54.480 --> 12:55.210
I'll head back now.

13:04.150 --> 13:04.710
Xuanye,

13:05.670 --> 13:06.670
she's quite lucky.

13:36.960 --> 13:37.620
My Lady,

13:37.870 --> 13:38.910
we can change the water now.

14:04.440 --> 14:10.870
[Zhang's Mansion]

14:20.270 --> 14:20.870
Have you finished the interrogation?

14:22.870 --> 14:23.620
There are more than 40 people in the whole household

14:23.650 --> 14:25.020
who need to be interrogated.

14:24.870 --> 14:28.050
[Wen Jian, a Chief Constable in Guangping City]

14:24.870 --> 14:28.050
[Li Mao, a constable in Guangping City]

14:25.050 --> 14:26.310
We're only halfway through.

14:27.600 --> 14:29.240
How long is this going to take?

14:29.870 --> 14:30.390
It's still early.

14:30.670 --> 14:31.450
Just wait patiently.

14:34.600 --> 14:35.830
Later, let's go to Kaiyuan Gambling House for a couple of rounds.

14:38.240 --> 14:39.150
My wife said that

14:39.600 --> 14:40.640
if I go to the gambling house again,

14:42.080 --> 14:43.320
she'll break this leg of mine.

14:46.300 --> 14:47.050
Then do you think

14:47.070 --> 14:48.400
the next person passing by will be a man or a woman?

14:51.910 --> 14:52.360
A woman.

14:53.850 --> 14:54.650
So sure?

14:55.150 --> 14:55.630
Want to make a bet?

14:58.550 --> 14:59.170
What will we bet on?

15:00.620 --> 15:01.640
Tomorrow is payday.

15:01.670 --> 15:02.650
Let's bet on this month's salary.

15:03.120 --> 15:03.770
You said it.

15:03.940 --> 15:04.690
No backing out.

15:04.720 --> 15:05.420
I'm a dog if I back out.

15:11.370 --> 15:12.190
What are you laughing?

15:15.150 --> 15:15.790
What happened?

15:17.870 --> 15:19.120
There's been a murder at Zhang's Mansion.

15:19.480 --> 15:20.210
Our people from the government office

15:20.240 --> 15:21.120
have already sealed

15:21.140 --> 15:21.750
both ends of the road.

15:22.030 --> 15:22.550
No one is allowed to pass

15:22.570 --> 15:23.670
except for government personnel.

15:24.510 --> 15:25.150
So what?

15:25.480 --> 15:26.630
At worst, we'll call it a draw.

15:27.580 --> 15:28.450
No, no.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.480
This road is the one

15:29.790 --> 15:30.480
Mrs. Zhang takes

15:30.510 --> 15:31.510
when buying vegetables.

15:32.090 --> 15:33.330
She cooks for our government office,

15:33.600 --> 15:34.150
so she's naturally considered

15:34.150 --> 15:34.910
one of our people.

15:35.360 --> 15:37.410
That's why I just let her pass.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.360
She should be back

15:41.390 --> 15:42.870
from buying vegetables by now.

15:44.870 --> 15:45.240
Well...

15:45.630 --> 15:46.390
It may not necessarily be her.

15:46.720 --> 15:47.390
Not necessarily?

15:48.600 --> 15:49.590
Don't try to weasel out of it.

15:55.320 --> 15:56.000
Mrs. Zhang!

15:56.320 --> 15:56.890
Mrs. Zhang!

15:57.270 --> 15:58.910
Hurry up, hurry up.

16:05.270 --> 16:05.670
Chief!

16:05.910 --> 16:07.240
Don't stop there, don't!

16:07.270 --> 16:08.150
Hurry, hurry, Chief!

16:16.360 --> 16:16.840
Chief!

16:17.000 --> 16:17.870
You've come just in time.

16:18.670 --> 16:19.310
Who won?

16:19.600 --> 16:20.120
I did.

16:21.320 --> 16:22.240
You never learn, do you?

16:22.790 --> 16:23.510
Who told you to come back?

16:32.630 --> 16:33.270
Where's Madam Li?

16:34.790 --> 16:35.670
Today,

16:35.690 --> 16:37.450
I've been busy in the backyard all day.

16:38.550 --> 16:39.390
I really...

16:39.390 --> 16:40.030
Chief Constable Chu.

16:40.630 --> 16:41.280
My Lord, I...

16:41.390 --> 16:41.940
Where's the body?

16:42.320 --> 16:42.830
Chief Chu.

16:43.360 --> 16:44.090
The body is inside the room.

17:00.140 --> 17:02.090
[Yan Li, a constable in Guangping City]

17:00.350 --> 17:00.720
Chief.

17:01.510 --> 17:02.380
The servants said

17:02.960 --> 17:04.670
that the deceased wasn't someone from the mansion,

17:05.310 --> 17:06.210
but the clothes

17:06.240 --> 17:07.640
and jewelry she was wearing

17:07.750 --> 17:09.069
were all Madam Zhang's.

17:31.260 --> 17:38.610
[Guangping Government]

17:39.750 --> 17:40.110
My Lord.

17:40.720 --> 17:41.450
What's the situation?

17:42.720 --> 17:43.670
When we arrived,

17:43.830 --> 17:44.960
Madam Zhang had already disappeared.

17:46.070 --> 17:47.200
According to the servants in the mansion,

17:47.830 --> 17:48.450
a few days ago,

17:48.480 --> 17:49.880
Madam Zhang suddenly appeared radiant,

17:50.240 --> 17:51.210
as if she had become

17:51.240 --> 17:52.240
ten years younger overnight.

17:53.110 --> 17:54.200
The servants were surprised,

17:54.590 --> 17:55.920
but they all assumed she had used

17:56.110 --> 17:57.160
some sort of beauty remedy,

17:57.440 --> 17:58.510
so they didn't make a fuss.

17:59.810 --> 18:00.410
Last night, Zhang's Mansion

18:00.440 --> 18:01.880
hosted guests, and during the banquet,

18:02.510 --> 18:03.590
Madam Zhang suddenly felt dizzy

18:03.720 --> 18:04.510
and went to her room to rest.

18:04.920 --> 18:05.550
Since then,

18:05.750 --> 18:06.880
she never left the room again.

18:07.040 --> 18:08.630
[Geng Zhen, Prefectural Governor of Guangping]

18:07.830 --> 18:08.750
However, what's strange is that

18:09.430 --> 18:10.320
we found the body of a woman

18:10.350 --> 18:10.960
in her bedroom, appearing to be

18:10.980 --> 18:12.500
in her seventies or eighties.

18:13.350 --> 18:14.920
The deceased was not someone from the mansion,

18:15.350 --> 18:16.310
but the clothes and jewelry she was wearing

18:16.440 --> 18:17.350
were all Madam Zhang's.

18:20.550 --> 18:21.680
This situation is a bit suspicious.

18:23.060 --> 18:23.500
Youhuang.

18:23.710 --> 18:24.030
Yes.

18:24.480 --> 18:25.160
What's your opinion?

18:26.870 --> 18:28.110
I humbly speculate

18:28.550 --> 18:29.640
that someone sneaked into the mansion

18:29.920 --> 18:30.680
and abducted Madam Zhang.

18:31.310 --> 18:32.240
As for the body,

18:33.190 --> 18:34.270
I don't have any clues for now.

18:38.000 --> 18:38.510
Wen Jian,

18:39.790 --> 18:40.160
My Lord.

18:41.000 --> 18:41.880
What do you think?

18:42.350 --> 18:42.750
I...

18:44.160 --> 18:45.240
I completely agree

18:45.440 --> 18:46.400
with Chief Constable Chu's opinion.

18:52.160 --> 18:53.200
Madam Zhang is an official's wife

18:53.400 --> 18:54.310
of noble status.

18:54.590 --> 18:55.310
We must not be careless.

18:55.640 --> 18:56.440
We must investigate thoroughly

18:56.750 --> 18:57.480
and solve the case as soon as possible.

19:00.590 --> 19:01.030
Yes.

19:28.750 --> 19:29.890
It's raining so heavily.

19:29.920 --> 19:31.270
I was planning to go out and take a walk.

19:33.650 --> 19:34.340
My Lady,

19:34.880 --> 19:36.490
I've already sent the letter back.

19:36.750 --> 19:38.200
It will take about 7 to 8 days to arrive.

19:39.300 --> 19:40.130
That means we'll have to wait

19:40.150 --> 19:41.320
at least half a month

19:41.350 --> 19:42.160
to receive the money

19:42.180 --> 19:43.050
sent from home.

19:46.200 --> 19:46.720
How much did you

19:46.750 --> 19:47.830
ask them to send?

19:51.030 --> 19:51.680
Two hundred taels of silver.

19:52.240 --> 19:53.290
Two hundred taels?

19:55.620 --> 19:57.810
Is he worth that much?

19:58.400 --> 20:00.000
Do you think capable demon hunters

20:00.030 --> 20:00.960
are just found everywhere?

20:01.730 --> 20:02.690
Well, we don't know

20:02.720 --> 20:04.030
if he's really that capable.

20:07.440 --> 20:09.260
But when I first heard you talk about him,

20:09.720 --> 20:11.020
I thought he was an old master

20:11.590 --> 20:13.050
with a white beard.

20:13.510 --> 20:14.880
I didn't expect him to be so young.

20:21.640 --> 20:22.400
What a heavy rain!

20:23.550 --> 20:24.400
Did you get wet?

20:24.680 --> 20:25.030
No.

20:25.790 --> 20:26.400
Hurry, pay your respects.

20:31.190 --> 20:35.890
[Ji Li, Dancer in Yunmen Dance Troupe]

20:31.190 --> 20:35.890
[Xu Zhizhi, Dancer in Yunmen Dance Troupe]

20:37.920 --> 20:38.920
Can you accompany me to offer a lamp?

20:51.040 --> 20:51.830
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

20:51.870 --> 20:52.820
-Did you get burned?
-My Lady.

20:53.200 --> 20:54.310
My Lady, are you alright?

20:54.480 --> 20:55.000
I'm fine.

20:55.350 --> 20:56.660
I got your shoes dirty.

20:57.000 --> 20:57.680
I'm so sorry.

20:59.270 --> 20:59.960
It's alright.

21:01.200 --> 21:02.410
Thank you for catching me.

21:02.520 --> 21:03.430
Otherwise, I would have fallen.

21:04.030 --> 21:04.690
This lamp

21:04.720 --> 21:05.960
must stay lit for three days and nights without going out.

21:06.400 --> 21:07.350
If it goes out, it won't be effective.

21:10.200 --> 21:10.830
It went out!

21:11.550 --> 21:12.400
It's okay, it's okay.

21:13.000 --> 21:13.790
We haven't offered it yet.

21:14.240 --> 21:15.090
I'll get you another one.

21:17.830 --> 21:19.710
But if it goes out, it won't be effective!

21:20.680 --> 21:21.720
What won't be effective?

21:24.200 --> 21:25.160
Don't you know?

21:25.530 --> 21:27.330
The Bodhisattva at Fa'en Temple is very powerful.

21:27.870 --> 21:29.290
As long as you offer a lamp in front of the Buddha

21:29.500 --> 21:30.700
and keep it lit for three days and nights,

21:31.310 --> 21:32.620
any wish you make

21:32.790 --> 21:33.440
will come true.

21:35.680 --> 21:36.410
Really?

21:36.720 --> 21:37.830
Then I'll go offer one too,

21:37.830 --> 21:38.310
My Lady.

21:43.240 --> 21:44.350
Miss, are you from out of town?

21:45.400 --> 21:46.270
How did you know?

21:47.070 --> 21:47.480
I took a guess.

21:48.510 --> 21:49.550
My name is Xu Zhizhi,

21:49.640 --> 21:50.930
and this is Sister Ji Li.

21:51.270 --> 21:52.590
We're from Yunmen Dance Troupe.

21:53.270 --> 21:54.000
If you have time,

21:54.030 --> 21:55.310
you can come and watch our performance.

21:57.440 --> 21:57.920
Okay.

21:59.160 --> 22:00.160
What's your name?

22:01.440 --> 22:03.270
My surname is Duan. I'm Duan Banxia.

22:03.790 --> 22:05.040
What a nice name.

22:06.550 --> 22:07.490
How so?

22:09.070 --> 22:10.310
It just sounds quite full.

22:12.110 --> 22:12.920
Full?

22:13.680 --> 22:14.440
Well, in summer,

22:14.920 --> 22:16.070
there are plenty of fruits and vegetables.

22:19.810 --> 22:20.780
And pears to eat too.

22:21.440 --> 22:21.880
Right.

22:22.270 --> 22:23.400
On our way here,

22:23.400 --> 22:24.310
we bought some pears.

22:29.300 --> 22:30.750
Sister Ji Li doesn't like pears.

22:34.240 --> 22:35.100
It smells so good.

22:36.500 --> 22:37.650
But I can't eat them either.

22:38.070 --> 22:38.960
I want to lose weight.

22:39.240 --> 22:40.640
I'm offering the lamp to get slimmer.

22:40.960 --> 22:41.790
Next time you see me,

22:41.920 --> 22:42.790
don't fail to recognize me

22:42.790 --> 22:43.680
because I'm thinner.

22:50.830 --> 22:51.480
Xuanye,

22:52.680 --> 22:53.950
it has been so long and they still haven't come out.

22:54.640 --> 22:55.850
Could they have been eaten by the sound eel?

22:57.310 --> 22:58.000
No.

22:59.350 --> 22:59.930
Why?

23:03.960 --> 23:05.200
Is it because the sound eel believes in Buddhism

23:05.400 --> 23:06.600
and wouldn't kill inside a temple?

23:16.070 --> 23:16.710
There's a snake!

23:25.350 --> 23:25.830
The rain has stopped.

23:26.340 --> 23:27.410
Where do you live?

23:28.350 --> 23:29.810
On Sifang Street, Changping Alley.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.100
I know that area.

23:32.440 --> 23:33.800
There was a murder case there before,

23:33.830 --> 23:34.240
right?

23:34.720 --> 23:35.750
Sister Ji Li, was it there?

23:36.750 --> 23:37.270
I don't know.

23:38.680 --> 23:39.650
You weren't with us back then.

23:44.640 --> 23:45.960
What murder case?

23:46.960 --> 23:47.680
You don't know?

23:48.160 --> 23:48.750
Six years ago,

23:49.160 --> 23:50.370
a murder case happened

23:50.400 --> 23:51.590
in Changping Alley on Sifang Street.

23:53.110 --> 23:55.000
The youngest son of a family

23:55.160 --> 23:56.720
killed his parents, older brother,

23:57.240 --> 23:58.210
and even three people

23:58.240 --> 23:59.400
who were working for them.

24:00.310 --> 24:01.200
It was quite a sensation at the time.

24:02.350 --> 24:03.310
Why did he do it?

24:03.830 --> 24:06.240
I heard it was because his parents were biased

24:06.610 --> 24:08.220
and planned to leave all the inheritance to the older son.

24:08.830 --> 24:09.820
So the younger son, in a fit of rage,

24:09.850 --> 24:10.980
killed the whole family.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.310
Since then,

24:12.550 --> 24:13.990
the feng shui there hasn't been good.

24:14.350 --> 24:15.240
No one wants to go there anymore.

24:15.960 --> 24:16.720
Over time,

24:16.750 --> 24:18.000
businesses couldn't run there anymore.

24:18.480 --> 24:19.750
You said the rent was cheap earlier,

24:20.070 --> 24:20.880
and that's the reason.

24:21.310 --> 24:22.480
Which household was it?

24:25.960 --> 24:27.000
I heard it's a pharmacy.

24:27.590 --> 24:28.030
Let's go.

24:28.880 --> 24:30.440
Which pharmacy was it?

24:31.160 --> 24:32.200
I'm not sure about that.

24:33.270 --> 24:34.680
Don't listen to Zhizhi's nonsense.

24:35.030 --> 24:35.830
She's the type of person

24:36.000 --> 24:36.750
who loves to gossip

24:37.070 --> 24:38.070
and listens to street rumors.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.680
Eight out of ten things

24:39.790 --> 24:40.960
she says are false.

24:41.310 --> 24:42.310
Don't take it to heart.

24:42.960 --> 24:43.960
I do not!

24:45.550 --> 24:46.280
I've lived here

24:46.310 --> 24:47.440
for so many years.

24:47.640 --> 24:49.300
How could I be wrong about something so big?

24:50.160 --> 24:50.790
Anyway, if you guys

24:50.790 --> 24:51.660
aren't short on money,

24:51.830 --> 24:52.680
just move out.

24:55.920 --> 24:56.400
Xuanye,

24:56.750 --> 24:57.640
they're talking bad about you.

24:58.160 --> 24:58.920
Let's not help them anymore.

25:05.240 --> 25:05.880
My Lady,

25:06.670 --> 25:07.960
could the person she was talking about

25:08.090 --> 25:09.370
be the demon hunter next door?

25:09.880 --> 25:11.110
His Ganshan Clinic

25:11.130 --> 25:12.270
is a pharmacy.

25:13.400 --> 25:14.690
I don't think it's him.

25:15.550 --> 25:16.680
It was such a serious crime.

25:17.000 --> 25:17.830
If it were really him,

25:18.000 --> 25:19.400
he would have been arrested long ago.

25:20.880 --> 25:21.550
That makes sense.

25:23.000 --> 25:23.590
My Lady,

25:24.080 --> 25:24.690
do you know if he has

25:24.720 --> 25:25.680
any relatives?

25:28.230 --> 25:28.880
Isn't the one

25:28.880 --> 25:30.000
who's always by his side

25:30.440 --> 25:31.350
his younger brother?

25:31.920 --> 25:32.640
You mean Chi Xue?

25:33.480 --> 25:34.480
He's a demon.

25:34.880 --> 25:35.400
A demon?

25:36.920 --> 25:38.030
What kind of demon?

25:38.830 --> 25:39.640
A rabbit demon.

25:40.720 --> 25:42.030
A... a rabbit?

25:43.070 --> 25:44.640
Can a rabbit become a demon?

25:45.030 --> 25:46.030
You didn't know?

25:48.160 --> 25:49.830
You never told me.

25:51.630 --> 25:52.760
But it's not important.

25:53.100 --> 25:54.180
And you don't need to be afraid.

25:54.590 --> 25:56.400
Chi Xue is quite nice, isn't he?

25:56.550 --> 25:57.240
But isn't Physician Jiu

25:57.260 --> 25:58.640
a demon hunter?

25:59.680 --> 26:00.920
Why does he have a demon by his side?

26:03.000 --> 26:03.790
It's so strange.

26:05.000 --> 26:06.240
Maybe demons are divided into good and bad ones.

26:12.310 --> 26:12.920
Ungrateful.

26:24.790 --> 26:25.550
My Lady,

26:26.640 --> 26:27.450
was the rabbit demon

26:27.480 --> 26:28.680
talking about us?

26:35.480 --> 26:36.880
What murder case?

26:37.790 --> 26:38.550
Don't you know?

26:39.000 --> 26:39.590
Six years ago,

26:39.920 --> 26:40.970
a murder case happened

26:41.000 --> 26:42.410
in Changping Alley on Sifang Street.

26:43.720 --> 26:45.590
The youngest son of a family

26:45.810 --> 26:47.420
killed his parents, older brother,

26:47.920 --> 26:48.930
and even three people

26:48.960 --> 26:50.110
who were working for them.

26:51.000 --> 26:51.960
It was quite a sensation at the time.

26:53.550 --> 26:54.160
I don't have any family.

26:55.160 --> 26:56.410
If you come to Guangping,

26:56.440 --> 26:58.320
you can find me at Ganshan Clinic in Changping Alley,

26:58.350 --> 26:59.200
Sifang Street.

28:44.270 --> 28:44.960
Let's do it here.

28:47.300 --> 28:47.850
Xuanye,

28:48.400 --> 28:49.620
this guy is really bad.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.000
Let's just kill him.

28:51.830 --> 28:53.480
Although he was controlled by the Human-faced Owl,

28:53.640 --> 28:54.660
his intelligence has not yet been awakened.

28:55.110 --> 28:55.880
He was just

28:56.210 --> 28:57.080
a weapon

28:57.110 --> 28:58.480
in the Human-faced Owl's hand anyway.

28:59.110 --> 29:00.330
There's no need to completely annihilate him.

29:00.920 --> 29:01.480
We just need to

29:01.720 --> 29:03.090
take his primodal spirit.

29:04.920 --> 29:05.400
Alright.

29:08.750 --> 29:09.700
Step back a bit more.

29:09.960 --> 29:11.140
The Moon Bugs feed on primordial spirit.

30:05.550 --> 30:06.280
Physician Jiu.

30:06.640 --> 30:07.160
Is something wrong?

30:08.640 --> 30:11.300
I think I caught a cold last night.

30:11.830 --> 30:13.560
I woke up feeling unwell today.

30:13.880 --> 30:15.190
Aren't you a physician?

30:15.440 --> 30:16.590
I rushed over to see you.

30:19.000 --> 30:19.650
Come in.

30:27.400 --> 30:28.640
The soup is boiling.

30:40.000 --> 30:41.260
You're making mutton soup?

30:43.720 --> 30:44.550
Don't touch it.

30:44.960 --> 30:46.880
That soup isn't for humans.

30:48.720 --> 30:49.240
Come here.

31:05.750 --> 31:06.400
The other hand.

31:11.640 --> 31:12.610
What's this?

31:20.720 --> 31:21.970
There's nothing seriously wrong with your body.

31:22.170 --> 31:23.380
Just go home and have a good rest.

31:24.550 --> 31:25.550
Don't you need to prescribe any medicine?

31:26.590 --> 31:27.160
No need.

31:31.830 --> 31:32.890
If you're still worried,

31:33.170 --> 31:33.780
you can go home

31:33.810 --> 31:34.970
and have some ginger water

31:35.240 --> 31:35.960
to sweat it out.

31:37.150 --> 31:37.560
Okay.

31:38.350 --> 31:39.240
Thank you, Physician Jiu.

31:54.920 --> 31:55.720
Is there anything else?

31:58.030 --> 31:59.030
Chi Xue isn't here?

32:00.590 --> 32:01.590
What do you need Chi Xue for?

32:02.900 --> 32:04.420
I just moved here,

32:04.760 --> 32:06.080
and there isn't much in my house.

32:06.110 --> 32:07.310
I want to buy some things from the street,

32:07.830 --> 32:09.280
but I'm afraid I won't be able to carry everything back,

32:09.310 --> 32:10.440
so I want to ask him for help.

32:13.270 --> 32:14.200
Chi Xue is a demon.

32:15.410 --> 32:16.650
I know. A rabbit demon.

32:17.400 --> 32:18.060
I've seen it.

32:19.000 --> 32:19.640
You're not afraid?

32:21.550 --> 32:22.480
He's one of your people.

32:22.800 --> 32:24.150
So he must be a good demon.

32:28.550 --> 32:29.160
Xuanye,

32:29.590 --> 32:31.280
did you hear

32:31.310 --> 32:32.720
Tingzhou and me talking yesterday?

32:34.400 --> 32:36.000
We really didn't mean to.

32:36.460 --> 32:38.070
We just heard others discussing it,

32:38.100 --> 32:39.450
so we talked about it for a little while.

32:39.840 --> 32:40.320
I know

32:40.350 --> 32:41.680
the one they were talking about definitely wasn't you.

32:42.110 --> 32:42.510
I...

32:43.030 --> 32:43.590
It was me.

32:49.240 --> 32:50.640
I was the one

32:50.920 --> 32:52.070
who killed my parents, older brother,

32:52.960 --> 32:53.510
and the three workers.

32:58.200 --> 32:58.720
You don't believe it?

33:01.160 --> 33:01.880
I don't believe it.

33:02.200 --> 33:03.460
If it really were you,

33:03.720 --> 33:05.160
you would've been arrested by the government office long ago.

33:08.350 --> 33:09.720
Maybe I

33:09.740 --> 33:11.060
bribed the officials

33:11.200 --> 33:12.380
to avoid being caught.

33:14.830 --> 33:16.080
It was such a big case.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.370
Not to mention whether you could

33:17.400 --> 33:18.370
pay to cover it up,

33:18.920 --> 33:20.630
even if it really was you who did it,

33:21.270 --> 33:22.220
as you said,

33:23.520 --> 33:24.240
I believe you must have

33:24.270 --> 33:25.240
your own reasons.

33:30.720 --> 33:32.310
Just like my father's disappearance.

33:32.920 --> 33:34.750
Everyone says he's dead,

33:35.720 --> 33:36.940
but I know he's not.

33:39.310 --> 33:40.070
This world

33:40.070 --> 33:41.310
isn't always what it

33:41.310 --> 33:42.350
appears to be.

33:43.240 --> 33:44.270
Many things

33:45.270 --> 33:46.790
cannot be understood by common sense.

33:52.880 --> 33:53.400
Also,

33:54.590 --> 33:56.300
when I first met you,

33:56.480 --> 33:57.660
I felt you were a good person,

33:57.920 --> 33:59.660
a person who strangely made me want to believe in you.

34:00.490 --> 34:01.320
So I believe

34:01.350 --> 34:02.960
you wouldn't do anything bad.

34:13.710 --> 34:14.550
Where are you going?

34:21.360 --> 34:22.370
Why are you following me?

34:22.630 --> 34:23.840
I haven't finished what I was saying.

34:25.150 --> 34:26.010
What else do you want to say?

34:27.480 --> 34:27.840
Well,

34:28.070 --> 34:29.520
last time you said you charge

34:29.550 --> 34:30.510
for your services.

34:31.639 --> 34:32.679
But you never mentioned

34:32.710 --> 34:33.940
how much.

34:33.960 --> 34:34.889
And you've been to

34:34.920 --> 34:35.850
my grandmother's residence.

34:35.880 --> 34:37.110
It's not an ordinary household.

34:37.230 --> 34:38.730
As long as you're willing to go back to Nanyang with me

34:38.760 --> 34:39.560
and find my father,

34:39.590 --> 34:41.139
I can give you as much money as you want.

34:42.480 --> 34:42.969
Is that so?

34:43.190 --> 34:43.699
Yes.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.650
And didn't you say that

34:45.840 --> 34:47.480
I have the ability to see demons?

34:47.550 --> 34:49.190
This is a one-in-ten-thousand gift.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.690
I can help you.

34:50.760 --> 34:52.159
It'll definitely make things easier.

34:55.880 --> 34:56.560
You help me?

34:59.030 --> 35:00.380
Have you been to Guangping before?

35:00.760 --> 35:01.320
Yes, I have.

35:02.580 --> 35:04.070
When I was little,

35:04.110 --> 35:05.710
my father worked at the government office

35:05.730 --> 35:06.560
in Guangping.

35:08.080 --> 35:09.460
We moved away

35:09.480 --> 35:10.640
after my mother passed.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.840
So you're quite familiar with Guangping.

35:14.800 --> 35:17.010
Not really.

35:17.920 --> 35:19.760
It was when I was a kid.

35:23.630 --> 35:24.230
That's perfect.

35:24.510 --> 35:25.630
You can take a closer look now.

35:26.110 --> 35:26.480
Come.

35:32.550 --> 35:34.110
Guangping has been the capital for three dynasties.

35:34.840 --> 35:36.190
People have been living here

35:36.400 --> 35:37.550
since the Shang and Zhou dynasties,

35:38.230 --> 35:40.030
and it has been thousands of years.

35:40.670 --> 35:42.000
It really is bustling.

35:44.360 --> 35:44.880
Yes,

35:45.480 --> 35:46.330
it really is bustling.

35:49.230 --> 35:50.000
Didn't you say

35:50.320 --> 35:51.760
you have a one-in-ten-thousand gift?

35:52.800 --> 35:53.190
Come,

35:53.510 --> 35:54.190
take a good look.

35:55.000 --> 35:56.030
Tell me which ones are humans

35:56.360 --> 35:57.190
and which ones are demons

35:57.800 --> 35:58.710
on this street. Are you okay?

36:03.580 --> 36:04.310
Help!

36:05.710 --> 36:06.440
Help!

36:07.890 --> 36:09.600
Help!

36:15.400 --> 36:16.150
Xuanye!

36:30.230 --> 36:31.750
[This area is dangerous. Civilians are forbidden to enter]

36:38.510 --> 36:39.150
Xuanye!

36:39.710 --> 36:40.320
Xuanye!

36:57.070 --> 36:57.710
Are you alright?

36:58.360 --> 36:59.540
This area is off-limits.

36:59.880 --> 37:00.960
Why are you here?

37:01.400 --> 37:02.920
I saw there weren't many people here,

37:03.000 --> 37:04.430
so I thought I'd come to catch some fish.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.400
Catch fish?

37:07.510 --> 37:08.190
Do you know

37:08.190 --> 37:09.280
how dangerous this place is?

37:09.840 --> 37:11.880
This river connects to the Underground City,

37:12.400 --> 37:13.730
where humans and demons are mixed together.

37:13.760 --> 37:14.590
It's extremely dangerous.

37:15.070 --> 37:15.960
If you had been swept into

37:15.980 --> 37:17.300
the Underground City by the river just now

37:17.400 --> 37:18.480
and caught by demons,

37:18.670 --> 37:19.510
you'd never have come back.

37:19.880 --> 37:20.710
Kind sir, you're lying.

37:20.800 --> 37:21.850
Our teacher said

37:21.880 --> 37:23.320
there are no demons in the world.

37:24.660 --> 37:25.470
That's because

37:25.560 --> 37:26.200
your teacher

37:26.230 --> 37:27.440
has never seen a demon.

37:28.110 --> 37:29.480
Our teacher is well-learned and knowledgeable.

37:29.670 --> 37:30.840
He can't be wrong.

37:33.480 --> 37:34.630
You believe your teacher, huh?

37:35.550 --> 37:35.880
Fine.

37:37.030 --> 37:37.440
Let's go.

37:37.960 --> 37:38.670
I'll take you to see for yourselves.

37:38.670 --> 37:38.920
No!

37:38.920 --> 37:40.510
No, no, no!

37:41.360 --> 37:42.050
Scared now, aren't you?

37:43.550 --> 37:44.190
Then don't come to

37:44.190 --> 37:44.850
this place again.

37:44.880 --> 37:45.400
Got it?

37:45.550 --> 37:46.840
-Yes.
-Yes.

37:48.150 --> 37:48.510
Alright.

37:48.920 --> 37:49.360
Go back now.

37:50.490 --> 37:52.090
Thank you, kind sir.

38:02.440 --> 38:03.510
Why did you follow me here?

38:07.020 --> 38:08.840
Was what you just told those children true,

38:08.840 --> 38:10.400
or were you just lying to them?

38:13.630 --> 38:14.360
Do you know

38:14.380 --> 38:15.520
what the Underground City is like?

38:16.030 --> 38:16.850
The Underground City

38:16.960 --> 38:18.510
is an isolated city,

38:19.590 --> 38:20.960
discovered over a hundred years ago.

38:22.030 --> 38:23.590
No one knows who built it

38:24.230 --> 38:25.160
or when

38:25.190 --> 38:26.110
it was built.

38:27.320 --> 38:29.110
That place is remote and hard to find,

38:29.960 --> 38:31.360
which is why many businesses,

38:31.810 --> 38:32.370
including some

38:32.400 --> 38:33.730
shady dealings,

38:34.110 --> 38:35.190
are conducted there.

38:35.880 --> 38:36.960
As you just heard,

38:37.630 --> 38:39.320
the Underground City is a mix of humans and demons,

38:39.590 --> 38:40.360
and it's very dangerous.

38:41.000 --> 38:42.480
You've been talking about your father,

38:42.720 --> 38:43.200
but that's just

38:43.220 --> 38:44.350
your side of the story.

38:45.030 --> 38:46.550
Whether there are demons causing trouble,

38:46.840 --> 38:47.840
or it's just that you can't accept

38:47.860 --> 38:49.050
the fact that your loved one is gone,

38:49.510 --> 38:50.490
I'm not sure yet.

38:51.510 --> 38:53.110
My father must still be alive.

38:54.840 --> 38:56.500
If your father is in the Underground City,

38:56.630 --> 38:57.280
would you dare to go there?

38:59.920 --> 39:01.270
Why wouldn't I dare?

39:02.030 --> 39:03.240
No matter what danger there is,

39:03.550 --> 39:04.080
I must

39:04.100 --> 39:05.100
rescue my father.

39:05.800 --> 39:06.730
If you're willing to help me,

39:06.760 --> 39:07.760
that would be the best.

39:08.030 --> 39:09.580
If not,

39:09.800 --> 39:10.880
I can't force you.

39:12.920 --> 39:13.440
How about this?

39:13.760 --> 39:14.550
Name your price.

39:16.880 --> 39:18.510
You talk like you're really rich.

39:19.280 --> 39:20.510
I really am rich.

39:21.710 --> 39:22.840
Do you have a thousand taels?

39:24.320 --> 39:24.710
I do.

39:26.670 --> 39:27.280
Really?

39:28.070 --> 39:28.710
Really.

39:31.070 --> 39:32.230
Alright, give it to me.

39:33.710 --> 39:34.710
How can that work?

39:34.960 --> 39:36.190
You haven't signed the contract yet.

39:37.190 --> 39:38.110
I never sign contracts.

39:38.710 --> 39:39.620
If you have it, give it to me;

39:39.710 --> 39:40.480
if not, let's part ways.

39:41.150 --> 39:42.760
Don't be in such a rush.

39:43.440 --> 39:44.160
Besides,

39:44.190 --> 39:45.290
who carries a thousand taels around

39:45.320 --> 39:46.630
all the time?

39:47.390 --> 39:48.710
We've been walking for half a day

39:48.880 --> 39:50.000
and haven't even had breakfast.

39:50.410 --> 39:51.810
Let's go grab something to eat first.

39:52.320 --> 39:53.280
Let go of me.

39:54.250 --> 39:55.730
Come on, just come with me.

39:55.760 --> 39:57.360
I heard the food at Yanlai Restaurant

39:57.550 --> 39:58.960
is really good,

39:58.960 --> 40:00.440
and they have dancing performances.

40:01.590 --> 40:02.480
Let go of me.

40:02.500 --> 40:03.580
Let... let go of me. Let go.

40:05.190 --> 40:06.000
Please come in.

40:06.270 --> 40:10.430
[Yanlai Restaurant]

40:06.360 --> 40:06.670
Alright.

40:10.750 --> 40:11.180
Hello,

40:11.480 --> 40:12.360
what would you like to order?

40:14.310 --> 40:16.070
We've never been here before.

40:16.670 --> 40:18.230
Waiter, what do you recommend?

40:18.400 --> 40:19.760
We have three signature dishes:

40:20.070 --> 40:22.110
roasted camel hump, grilled lamb, and stewed bass.

40:22.460 --> 40:23.690
What would you like to eat?

40:27.960 --> 40:29.840
We'll have one of each,

40:30.960 --> 40:32.480
and a pepper flatbread.

40:32.800 --> 40:33.360
Certainly.

40:36.230 --> 40:37.920
You're quite the spendthrift.

40:39.760 --> 40:41.070
I'm just treating an important guest.

40:42.440 --> 40:43.840
I'm usually very frugal.

40:55.070 --> 40:56.040
Didn't they say they have

40:56.070 --> 40:57.150
song and dance performances here?

40:57.810 --> 40:58.610
Would you like to watch?

40:58.910 --> 40:59.930
If so,

41:00.020 --> 41:00.730
I can ask them to move us

41:00.760 --> 41:01.440
to the first floor.

41:02.280 --> 41:02.880
No need.

41:03.230 --> 41:03.730
It's fine.

41:03.760 --> 41:04.550
This place is just fine.

41:09.070 --> 41:10.280
Hurry up, every one!

41:11.150 --> 41:12.320
Is everyone inside ready?

41:14.670 --> 41:15.190
Manager.

41:15.480 --> 41:16.150
Where's Tian Rui?

41:16.400 --> 41:17.150
Why hasn't she come out yet?

41:17.360 --> 41:18.150
I don't know.

41:18.550 --> 41:20.000
Tian Rui asked me to come first.

41:19.090 --> 41:21.370
[Tian Rui, Dancer in Yunmen Dance Troupe]

41:20.280 --> 41:21.320
She'll be here soon.

41:24.920 --> 41:25.550
Ji Li,

41:26.070 --> 41:26.630
what do you think

41:27.110 --> 41:28.040
Tian Rui is using

41:28.070 --> 41:29.030
for beauty?

41:29.320 --> 41:30.440
It's unbelievable.

41:30.800 --> 41:32.590
She looks like she's reversed aging overnight.

41:33.480 --> 41:35.170
This is all over the city now.

41:35.600 --> 41:36.810
Most of the people here tonight

41:36.840 --> 41:38.280
are probably just here to see her.

41:39.070 --> 41:39.800
Otherwise,

41:39.880 --> 41:40.400
the manager wouldn't

41:40.420 --> 41:41.570
have made you her supporting role.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.360
What are you waiting for?

41:44.400 --> 41:45.230
Go and hurry her up!

41:45.590 --> 41:46.070
Yes.

41:47.960 --> 41:48.880
There's no need to hurry me up.

41:49.840 --> 41:50.320
Manager,

41:50.470 --> 41:51.320
I'm ready.

41:51.440 --> 41:52.230
We can go on stage now.

41:52.550 --> 41:53.960
Finally.

41:54.450 --> 41:55.120
Come on, come on.

41:55.150 --> 41:56.230
Everyone, get moving! Come on!

41:56.710 --> 41:57.440
Don't just stand there.

41:57.480 --> 41:57.840
Hurry up!

41:58.190 --> 41:58.710
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

41:58.710 --> 41:59.590
Let's get ready to begin.

42:23.760 --> 42:24.480
Bravo!

42:24.800 --> 42:25.280
Bravo!

42:26.670 --> 42:27.110
Bravo!

42:27.760 --> 42:28.480
Something's wrong.
